{% doc %}
  One product highlighted on the home page (TE-13 AC1, AC2, Figma 1:759):
  image gallery, title, countdown frame, price with discount, rating,
  description, spec table, Add to cart and View Detail. Reads the product from
  block.settings.product, never the global product. templates/product.featured-product
  passes the global product as the product parameter, so ?view=featured-product
  returns the 3 partials below with the same markup for the requested variant.

  Layout (index-mobile-b.md §2, index-1280.md khối 10, TE-13 AC6): below 48rem
  one column, image 1:1 with the product contained, spec rows label above value,
  buttons stacked full width; from 48rem image 4:3, spec rows 2 columns, buttons
  in one row; from 64rem 2 columns 1fr | 80 | 1fr (580 | 80 | 580 at 1280),
  image 668 / 653. View Detail carries a visually hidden " of {product}"
  (TE-13 AC6) so the link name is unique on the page.

  Gallery (ADR 0012, Theme Store rich media): every media type of the product
  (image, video, YouTube/Vimeo, 3D model), 8 at most, scroll-snap, lazy, each
  item through snippets/product-media-item.liquid with zoom off (video poster
  with preload none, external iframe in a <template>, model over its preview).
  The gallery is a <product-media-gallery> with data-product-id and
  data-media-count, like the PDP; assets/product-media.js (BE, TS-BE1) plays
  external video and loads the 3D UI. From 2 media the list takes keyboard
  focus and thumbnails are in-page links, no JavaScript needed; video
  thumbnails carry a play badge, model thumbnails a 3D badge.
  The decorative seal (Figma 1:761) sits on the image corner.

  Countdown (ADR 0009, ADR 0011): snippets/sale-countdown, size regular, between
  the title and the price. End date from the product metafield
  custom.sale_ends_at, the countdown_end setting only when the product has none;
  no template parameter supplies a date. The snippet prints nothing unless the
  date is valid and after now and the current variant is available with a
  compare-at price above its price (R8, ES1-T155 #2); numbers show from the
  first paint, hidden without JavaScript. Editor-only notices for a malformed
  countdown_end and for a metafield that overrides it. The snippet sits in a
  div with data-sale-countdown-slot and display contents: always present, so a
  variant swap can replace it even when one side has no countdown.

  Rating: reviews.rating metafield, .value.rating over .value.scale_max, brought
  to a scale of 5. Hidden when the metafield is missing. reviews.rating_count adds
  the review count.

  Spec table: label from spec_n_label, value from metafield custom.spec_n. A row
  without either stays hidden; with no row left the table stays hidden.

  Form: same contract as blocks/product-form, so assets/product-form.js and
  assets/product-variant-picker.js run unchanged. A product that requires a
  selling plan has no form, only View Detail, because this block has no plan picker.

  JS hooks: featured-product (custom element, data-enhanced, data-design-mode);
  data-lazy-module (URL read by assets/lazy-module.js) on featured-product,
  on .featured-product__summary for sale-countdown.js (near viewport) and,
  outside the theme editor, on product-form and on .featured-product__details
  for the picker. With scripting the picker markup keeps its space from the
  first paint and shows once featured-product is defined, before the picker
  module loads (assets/featured-product.css). Both carry data-lazy-on="interaction" (ADR 0010): they load on
  the first pointerenter, focusin or touchstart inside the element; without
  JS the form still buys the current variant;
  data-sale-countdown-slot around the countdown; sale-countdown, data-sale-countdown,
  data-end (epoch seconds), data-state, data-size, data-label-ended and
  data-countdown-unit (days, hours, minutes, seconds) with data-countdown-value
  (snippets/sale-countdown, assets/sale-countdown.js);
  data-featured-media-id, data-media-id and data-media-type on each media item
  and thumbnail; product-media-gallery with data-product-id and
  data-media-count and data-lazy-module (product-media.js, near viewport); product-form with
  data-product-id, data-product-url, data-cart-add-url, data-cart-url,
  data-cart-type, data-label-add, data-label-added, data-label-sold-out,
  data-label-unavailable; data-fetch-url and data-regions on product-variant-picker.
  Partials (ADR 0008 item 3, one featured product per real page):
  product-options (the picker fieldsets, rendered by
  snippets/product-variant-picker because regions lists it: the server
  refreshes the legend and every value state after a change), product-price
  (data-variant-price; no price and no discount when the selected option
  values form no variant), product-buy-buttons (add button and
  snippets/selected-variant-data: one variant, null when the selected option
  values form no variant; the button then says Unavailable, disabled). With 2+
  featured products on a page the partial names repeat, so
  assets/featured-product.js swap() replaces the fieldsets, the price, the
  JSON, the button and the countdown slot of its own band from
  ?view=featured-product&option_values= (ES1-T169 D4).

  Test hooks: featured-product, featured-product-eyebrow, featured-product-title,
  featured-product-media, featured-product-media-item, featured-product-thumbnail,
  featured-product-price, featured-product-discount, featured-product-rating,
  featured-product-rating-count, featured-product-description,
  featured-product-specs, featured-product-spec, featured-product-countdown,
  featured-product-countdown-days, featured-product-countdown-hours,
  featured-product-countdown-minutes, featured-product-countdown-seconds,
  featured-product-countdown-label, featured-product-countdown-ends-on,
  featured-product-countdown-notice (snippets/sale-countdown), featured-product-add, featured-product-view-detail, featured-product-status,
  featured-product-error, featured-product-placeholder, featured-product-seal
  (snippets/featured-product-seal). Inside media items: product-media-image,
  product-media-video, product-media-external-video,
  product-media-external-video-template, product-media-model
  (snippets/product-media-item). Also product-variant-picker,
  product-option, product-option-value and price*. No select listing
  variants (TE-4 AC13, NFR-7): without JS the form buys the current variant.

  Empty state: no product selected → a hint in the theme editor, nothing on the
  storefront.

  Styles: assets/featured-product.css (this block and the seal), loaded by the
  stylesheet_tag line before the root, outside every partial, without preload
  (ADR 0014), only when the block prints markup (product set, or the theme
  editor) and never in the ?view=featured-product data view. Gallery, picker,
  form and countdown (.sale-countdown) styles stay in assets/base.css.

  Self-contained: callers must leave the body empty.

  @param {string} [id] - Static block id, needed when a template has more than one featured product
  @param {boolean} [hide_options] - True hides the variant picker, as on the home page (Figma 1:759). Default: false
  @param {boolean} [stylesheet] - False skips the stylesheet_tag line. Only templates/product.featured-product passes it: that layout none data view returns partials to a page that already has the link. Default: true

  @example
  {% block 'container', id: 'home-featured-product', tag: 'div' %}
    {% block 'featured-product', id: 'featured-product' %}{% endblock %}
  {% endblock %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign featured = block.settings.product
  # ADR 0014: link only when the block prints markup, else the container sees a non-empty body and renders an empty band. The data view (stylesheet: false, layout none) never prints it.
  assign load_stylesheet = false
  if featured != blank or request.design_mode
    assign load_stylesheet = true
  endif
  if stylesheet == false
    assign load_stylesheet = false
  endif
-%}

{%- if load_stylesheet -%}
  {{ 'featured-product.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if featured == blank -%}
  {%- if request.design_mode -%}
    <div
      class="featured-product featured-product--placeholder"
      data-testid="featured-product-placeholder"
      {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
    >
      {{ 'blocks.featured_product.placeholder' | t }}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign current_variant = featured.selected_or_first_available_variant
    assign form_id = 'product-form-' | append: featured.id
    assign cart_type = settings.cart_type | default: 'drawer'

    assign label_add = 'blocks.product_form.add_to_cart' | t
    assign label_added = 'blocks.product_form.added_to_cart' | t
    assign label_sold_out = 'blocks.product_form.sold_out' | t
    assign label_unavailable = 'blocks.product_form.unavailable' | t
    assign featured_title = featured.title
    assign view_detail_suffix = 'blocks.featured_product.view_detail_suffix' | t: product: featured_title

    assign has_variant_choice = true
    if featured.has_only_default_variant or featured.variants.size == 1
      assign has_variant_choice = false
    endif
    if hide_options
      assign has_variant_choice = false
    endif

    # Tổ hợp đang chọn không tạo thành biến thể: cùng quy tắc blocks/product-form (ADR 0008, ES1-T253)
    assign variant_exists = true
    if has_variant_choice
      for option in featured.options_with_values limit: 1
        for value in option.values
          if value.selected and value.variant == blank
            assign variant_exists = false
          endif
        endfor
      endfor
    endif
    assign can_buy = false
    if variant_exists and current_variant.available
      assign can_buy = true
    endif
    assign fetch_url = featured.url | append: '?view=featured-product'

    # Rich media (ADR 0012, Theme Store 4): every media type, 8 at most
    assign media_total = featured.media.size | at_most: 8
    assign description = featured.description | strip_html | strip | truncatewords: 80

    # Countdown (ADR 0009): snippets/sale-countdown decides whether it shows
    assign countdown_id = 'FeaturedCountdown-' | append: block.id

    assign rating_data = featured.metafields.reviews.rating.value
    assign rating_value = rating_data.rating
    if rating_value != blank
      assign rating_scale = rating_data.scale_max | plus: 0
      if rating_scale <= 0
        assign rating_scale = 5
      endif
      assign rating_on_five = rating_value | times: 5.0 | divided_by: rating_scale | round: 1
      assign rating_count = featured.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value
      if rating_count != blank
        assign rating_count_number = rating_count | plus: 0
      endif
    endif
  -%}

  {%- capture spec_rows -%}
    {%- for index in (1..4) -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign label_id = 'spec_' | append: index | append: '_label'
        assign metafield_key = 'spec_' | append: index
        assign spec_label = block.settings[label_id] | strip
        assign spec_value = featured.metafields.custom[metafield_key].value | strip
      -%}
      {%- if spec_label != blank and spec_value != blank -%}
        <tr class="featured-product__spec" data-testid="featured-product-spec">
          <th class="featured-product__spec-label" scope="row">{{ spec_label | escape }}</th>
          <td class="featured-product__spec-value">{{ spec_value | escape }}</td>
        </tr>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  <featured-product
    class="featured-product"
    {% if id != blank %}
      data-featured-product-id="{{ id }}"
    {% endif %}
    {% if request.design_mode %}
      data-design-mode
    {% endif %}
    data-lazy-module="{{ 'featured-product.js' | asset_url }}"
    data-testid="featured-product"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    <s-view-event
      class="featured-product__view"
      view-event-trigger="intersect"
      view-event-payload='{{ featured | standard_event_data: "view", context: "recommendation" | escape }}'
    >
      <product-media-gallery
        class="featured-product__gallery"
        data-product-id="{{ featured.id }}"
        data-media-count="{{ media_total }}"
        data-lazy-module="{{ 'product-media.js' | asset_url }}"
      >
        <ul
          class="featured-product__media-list"
          role="list"
          {% if media_total > 1 %}
            tabindex="0"
          {% endif %}
          aria-label="{{ 'blocks.featured_product.media_label' | t }}"
          data-testid="featured-product-media"
        >
          {%- for media in featured.media limit: 8 -%}
            <li
              class="featured-product__media-item"
              id="FeaturedMedia-{{ featured.id }}-{{ media.id }}"
              data-featured-media-id="{{ media.id }}"
              data-media-id="{{ media.id }}"
              data-media-type="{{ media.media_type }}"
              data-testid="featured-product-media-item"
            >
              {% render 'product-media-item',
                media: media,
                product: featured,
                loading: 'lazy',
                sizes: '(min-width: 64rem) 50vw, 100vw',
                widths: '360, 720, 1080, 1440',
                zoom: false
              %}
            </li>
          {%- else -%}
            <li class="featured-product__media-item">
              {{- 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'featured-product__placeholder-svg' -}}
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>

        {%- assign seal_id = 'FeaturedSeal-' | append: featured.id -%}
        {%- render 'featured-product-seal', id: seal_id -%}

        {%- if media_total > 1 -%}
          <ul class="featured-product__thumbnails" role="list" aria-label="{{ 'blocks.featured_product.thumbnails_label' | t }}">
            {%- for media in featured.media limit: 8 -%}
              <li>
                <a
                  class="featured-product__thumbnail"
                  href="#FeaturedMedia-{{ featured.id }}-{{ media.id }}"
                  data-featured-media-id="{{ media.id }}"
                  data-media-id="{{ media.id }}"
                  data-media-type="{{ media.media_type }}"
                  data-testid="featured-product-thumbnail"
                >
                  {%- if media.preview_image != blank -%}
                    {% render 'image',
                      image: media.preview_image,
                      width: 128,
                      height: 128,
                      crop: 'center',
                      widths: '64, 128',
                      sizes: '64px',
                      loading: 'lazy',
                      inline: true,
                      decorative: true
                    %}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- case media.media_type -%}
                    {%- when 'video', 'external_video' -%}
                      <span class="product-media__thumbnail-badge" aria-hidden="true">
                        {%- render 'slideshow-icon', name: 'play' -%}
                      </span>
                    {%- when 'model' -%}
                      <span class="product-media__thumbnail-badge product-media__thumbnail-badge--text" aria-hidden="true">
                        {{- 'blocks.featured_product.badge_model' | t -}}
                      </span>
                  {%- endcase -%}
                  <span class="visually-hidden">
                    {%- case media.media_type -%}
                      {%- when 'video', 'external_video' -%}
                        {{- 'blocks.featured_product.thumbnail_video_label' | t: index: forloop.index, total: media_total -}}
                      {%- when 'model' -%}
                        {{- 'blocks.featured_product.thumbnail_model_label' | t: index: forloop.index, total: media_total -}}
                      {%- else -%}
                        {{- 'blocks.featured_product.thumbnail_label' | t: index: forloop.index, total: media_total -}}
                    {%- endcase -%}
                  </span>
                </a>
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        {%- endif -%}
      </product-media-gallery>

      <div
        class="featured-product__details"
        {% if has_variant_choice %}
          {% unless request.design_mode or featured.requires_selling_plan %}
            data-lazy-module="{{ 'product-variant-picker.js' | asset_url }}"
          {% endunless %}
          data-lazy-on="interaction"
        {% endif %}
      >
        <div class="featured-product__header">
          {%- if block.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
            <p class="featured-product__eyebrow" data-testid="featured-product-eyebrow">
              {{- block.settings.eyebrow | escape -}}
            </p>
          {%- endif -%}
          <h2 class="featured-product__title" data-testid="featured-product-title">{{ featured.title | escape }}</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="sale-countdown-slot" data-sale-countdown-slot>
          {%- render 'sale-countdown',
            product: featured,
            variant: current_variant,
            fallback_end: block.settings.countdown_end,
            size: 'regular',
            label: block.settings.countdown_label,
            testid: 'featured-product-countdown',
            id: countdown_id
          -%}
        </div>

        <div class="featured-product__summary" data-lazy-module="{{ 'sale-countdown.js' | asset_url }}">
          {% partial 'product-price' %}
            <div class="featured-product__price" data-variant-price data-testid="featured-product-price">
              {%- if variant_exists -%}
                {% render 'price', product: featured, variant: current_variant %}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if variant_exists and current_variant.compare_at_price > current_variant.price -%}
                {%- assign discount_percent = current_variant.compare_at_price | minus: current_variant.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: current_variant.compare_at_price | round -%}
                <span class="featured-product__discount" data-testid="featured-product-discount">
                  {%- if discount_percent > 0 -%}
                    <bdi>{{ 'products.card.sale_percent' | t: percent: discount_percent }}</bdi>
                  {%- else -%}
                    <bdi>{{ 'products.card.sale' | t }}</bdi>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {% endpartial %}

          {%- if rating_value != blank -%}
            <div class="featured-product__rating" data-testid="featured-product-rating">
              {% render 'rating-stars', rating: rating_on_five %}
              <span class="featured-product__rating-value">
                {{- 'blocks.featured_product.rating_value' | t: rating: rating_on_five -}}
              </span>
              {%- if rating_count != blank -%}
                <span class="featured-product__rating-count" data-testid="featured-product-rating-count">
                  {{- 'blocks.featured_product.rating_count' | t: count: rating_count_number -}}
                </span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if description != blank -%}
            <p class="featured-product__description" data-testid="featured-product-description">{{ description }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- if spec_rows != blank -%}
          <table class="featured-product__specs" data-testid="featured-product-specs">
            <caption class="visually-hidden">{{ 'blocks.featured_product.specs_label' | t }}</caption>
            <tbody>
              {{- spec_rows -}}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if featured.requires_selling_plan -%}
          <div class="featured-product__actions">
            <a class="button button--secondary featured-product__view-detail" href="{{ featured.url }}" data-testid="featured-product-view-detail">
              {{- 'blocks.featured_product.view_detail' | t -}}
              <span class="visually-hidden"> {{ view_detail_suffix }}</span>
              {% render 'slideshow-icon', name: 'arrow' %}
            </a>
          </div>
        {%- else -%}
          <product-form
            class="featured-product__buy"
            {% unless request.design_mode %}
              data-lazy-module="{{ 'product-form.js' | asset_url }}"
            {% endunless %}
            data-lazy-on="interaction"
            data-product-id="{{ featured.id }}"
            data-product-url="{{ featured.url }}"
            data-cart-add-url="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"
            data-cart-url="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
            data-cart-type="{{ cart_type | escape }}"
            data-label-add="{{ label_add | escape }}"
            data-label-added="{{ label_added | escape }}"
            data-label-sold-out="{{ label_sold_out | escape }}"
            data-label-unavailable="{{ label_unavailable | escape }}"
          >
            {%- if has_variant_choice -%}
              {%- render 'product-variant-picker',
                product: featured,
                form_id: form_id,
                fetch_url: fetch_url,
                regions: 'product-options product-price product-buy-buttons'
              -%}
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- form 'product', featured, id: form_id, class: 'featured-product__actions' -%}
              <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ current_variant.id }}">

              {% partial 'product-buy-buttons' %}
                <div class="featured-product__add-wrapper">
                  {%- render 'selected-variant-data', variant: current_variant, exists: variant_exists -%}
                  <button
                    class="button featured-product__add"
                    type="submit"
                    name="add"
                    {% unless can_buy %}
                      disabled
                    {% endunless %}
                    data-testid="featured-product-add"
                  >
                    {%- if can_buy -%}
                      {% render 'header-icon', name: 'bag' %}
                    {%- endif -%}
                    <span class="product-form__add-label">
                      {%- if can_buy -%}
                        {{- label_add -}}
                      {%- elsif variant_exists -%}
                        {{- label_sold_out -}}
                      {%- else -%}
                        {{- label_unavailable -}}
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </span>
                  </button>
                </div>
              {% endpartial %}

              <a class="button button--secondary featured-product__view-detail" href="{{ featured.url }}" data-testid="featured-product-view-detail">
                {{- 'blocks.featured_product.view_detail' | t -}}
                <span class="visually-hidden"> {{ view_detail_suffix }}</span>
                {% render 'slideshow-icon', name: 'arrow' %}
              </a>
            {%- endform -%}

            <div class="visually-hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-testid="featured-product-status"></div>
            <div class="product-form__error" role="alert" data-testid="featured-product-error"></div>
          </product-form>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </s-view-event>
    <script src="{{ 'lazy-module.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
  </featured-product>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.featured_product",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "product",
      "id": "product",
      "label": "t:labels.featured_product"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "t:labels.eyebrow",
      "info": "t:info.sample_default",
      "default": "FEATURED PRODUCT · FREE WEIGHTS"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "countdown_label",
      "label": "t:labels.countdown_label",
      "info": "t:info.countdown_label"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "countdown_end",
      "label": "t:labels.countdown_end",
      "info": "t:info.countdown_end"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "spec_1_label",
      "label": "t:labels.spec_1_label",
      "info": "t:info.spec_label",
      "default": "Weight range"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "spec_2_label",
      "label": "t:labels.spec_2_label",
      "info": "t:info.spec_label",
      "default": "Footprint"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "spec_3_label",
      "label": "t:labels.spec_3_label",
      "info": "t:info.spec_label",
      "default": "Materials"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "spec_4_label",
      "label": "t:labels.spec_4_label",
      "info": "t:info.spec_label",
      "default": "Assembly"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
